---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Cookies: None, Not Even in the Care Grade Calculator" description="No cookies and no banner: the care grade, care allowance and care home calculators remember nothing. At most we measure anonymously whether a page loads without errors." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Cookies</h1>
    <p>This site <strong>sets no cookies</strong>, so it needs no consent banner. Details in the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <h2>Your assessment answers stay on your device</h2>
    <p>What you enter about mobility, memory or self-care is never stored in a cookie or in browser storage. Close the tab and it is gone; only a link you copy yourself contains the answers.</p>
    <h2>Anonymous error measurement</h2>
    <p>When enabled, Microsoft Clarity checks in <strong>cookieless</strong> mode whether pages load correctly. No cookies such as <code>_clck</code>, <code>_clsk</code>, <code>MUID</code> or <code>CLID</code> are created and inputs are masked.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Provider: Microsoft Ireland Operations Limited, Dublin, Ireland;</li>
      <li>Deletion: recordings after 30 days, aggregates after 13 months;</li>
      <li>Legal basis: Article 6(1)(f) GDPR.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Embedded calculators</h2>
    <p>The iframe versions load no measurement and set no cookies.</p>
    <p>To block measurement, block clarity.ms in your browser; every calculator keeps working. Questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. Last updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
